 "cred_prose": "(?:the|and|you|your|for|are|was|with|this|that|these|those|from|have|has|had|will|would|should|must|which|when|where|what|who|how|why|then|than|there|here|their|they|them|been|were|does|did|into|its|our|any|each|every|not|but|use|using|enter|type|reset|change|choose|required|in|on|at|of|to|is|it|as|by|or|be|so|if|we|my|an|up|do|he|me|us|go|am|set|stored|kept|saved|see|ask|get|via|per|can|may|keep|store|share|shown|never|only|just|also|ever|moved|managed)(?![a-z0-9_])",
